<section class="container page-section"><h1 class="h2">Poin belajar — <?php echo html_escape($learner_name); ?></h1><p class="h3"><?php echo (int) $summary['balance_points']; ?> poin</p><p>Poin milik anak, bukan kredit berbayar atau uang. Poin hanya dapat ditukar dengan paket yang tersedia untuk akun anak itu sendiri; tidak untuk Platinum, slot anak, top up, atau uang tunai.</p>
<div class="alert alert-info"><?php echo $rules['enabled'] === '1' ? 'Hadiah & penukaran aktif.' : 'Hadiah & penukaran belum diaktifkan. Nilai aturan masih draft; saldo/riwayat lama tetap tersimpan.'; ?> Satu set terukur hanya memberi hadiah sekali: <?php echo (int) $rules['reward']; ?> poin jika tuntas minimal <?php echo (int) $rules['pass_score']; ?>%, maksimal <?php echo (int) $rules['daily_cap']; ?> poin per hari WIB. Berlaku untuk babak baru Hitung Cepat, Math Expedition, Story, evaluasi Inggris dan Quest. Tidak ada poin dari battle/soal komunitas, klik iklan, flashcard atau sekadar membaca. Pengulangan tetap boleh tanpa hadiah tambahan. Aturan hadiah mengikuti awal babak; batas harian mengikuti aturan saat selesai.</div>
<?php if ($editable): ?><h2 class="h4">Tukar poin dengan akses belajar</h2><div class="row g-3 mb-4"><?php foreach ($packages as $p): ?><div class="col-md-6"><article class="feature-card"><h3 class="h5"><?php echo html_escape($p['title']); ?></h3><p><?php echo (int) $p['point_price']; ?> poin · akses <?php echo (int) $p['point_days']; ?> hari untuk akunmu.</p><?php if ($rules['enabled'] === '1'): ?><?php echo form_open('belajar/poin/tukar/'.(int) $p['id']); ?><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<?php echo (int) $p['revision']; ?>"><input type="hidden" name="request_key" value="<?php echo bin2hex(random_bytes(32)); ?>"><div class="form-check mb-3"><input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="points-<?php echo (int) $p['id']; ?>" name="confirm" value="1" required><label class="form-check-label" for="points-<?php echo (int) $p['id']; ?>">Aku memilih paket ini dan setuju poinku digunakan.</label></div><button class="btn btn-primary">Tukar poin</button><?php echo form_close(); ?><?php endif; ?></article></div><?php endforeach; ?><?php if ( ! $packages): ?><p>Belum ada paket penukaran. Tetap belajar sesuai ritmemu; tidak perlu mengejar poin.</p><?php endif; ?></div><?php endif; ?>
<h2 class="h4">Akses dari penukaran</h2><?php foreach ($summary['redemptions'] as $r): ?><?php $s = json_decode($r['snapshot_json'], TRUE); ?><article class="feature-card mb-3"><h3 class="h5"><?php echo html_escape($s['title']); ?></h3><p><?php echo (int) $s['points']; ?> poin · <?php echo html_escape(study_format_datetime($r['starts_at'])); ?> s.d. <?php echo html_escape(study_format_datetime($r['ends_at'])); ?> · <?php echo $r['status'] === 'revoked' ? 'Dicabut' : (strtotime($r['ends_at'].' UTC') <= time() ? 'Berakhir; progres tetap tersimpan' : 'Hak tercatat'); ?></p></article><?php endforeach; ?>
<h2 class="h4">Riwayat poin</h2><?php foreach ($summary['entries'] as $e): ?><article class="feature-card mb-3"><strong><?php echo (int) $e['delta_points'] > 0 ? '+' : ''; ?><?php echo (int) $e['delta_points']; ?> poin</strong><p><?php echo html_escape($e['note']); ?></p><small><?php echo html_escape(study_format_datetime($e['created_at'])); ?></small></article><?php endforeach; ?><?php if ( ! $summary['entries']): ?><p>Belum ada mutasi pada halaman ini.</p><?php endif; ?><nav aria-label="Halaman poin"><?php if ($page > 1): ?><a href="<?php echo site_url($base.'?halaman='.($page - 1)); ?>">Sebelumnya</a><?php endif; ?> · Halaman <?php echo (int) $page; ?> <?php if (count($summary['entries']) === 20 || count($summary['redemptions']) === 20): ?><a href="<?php echo site_url($base.'?halaman='.($page + 1)); ?>">Berikutnya</a><?php endif; ?></nav></section>
